{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1194","endTime":307556.126,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 04\nTukeeConnect.\n\nAn organization workspace with people lists, administrative navigation, and a dedicated account-entry experience.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nOrganization & collaboration\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nBring an organization into focus.\n\nTukeeConnect’s web artwork shows the distinction between starting an organization and joining an existing one. Inside the workspace, a persistent sidebar accompanies a structured people table. The interface places everyday organization information within reach of a single administrative view.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in TukeeConnect's original project material.\n\n01\nOrganization entry\n\nThe presentation distinguishes creating and joining an organization.\n\n02\nPeople directory\n\nA tabular view displays people and their associated information.\n\n03\nWorkspace navigation\n\nA sidebar groups the available administrative areas.\n\n04\nAccount access\n\nA focused sign-in screen provides a separate entry point.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nOrganization & collaboration\n\nBlue headings and actions anchor a mostly white interface. Compact rows, aligned columns, and a restrained sidebar support information-heavy screens, while the login presentation keeps the same identity in a simpler form.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside TukeeConnect.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nTukeeConnect's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nTukeeConnect / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nBeliri\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nFASHION & COMMERCE\nBeliri\nPHOTOGRAPHY & COMMERCE\nPrintlific\nTALENT & RECRUITMENT\nNerdrabbit\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
